OL,3,APutin vows 'far more painful' response 
OL,4,Ato Ukraine's strikes on Crimean Bridge 
OL,6,FMoscow's retaliation for attacks on the
OL,7,FCrimean Bridge will be "far more       
OL,8,Fpainful" than Kyiv's strikes, Vladimir 
OL,9,FPutin has vowed.                       
OL,11,FIn the early hours of Thursday, the    
OL,12,Fdouble-arched, 12-mile bridge          
OL,13,Fconnecting Russia to Ukraine's occupied
OL,14,Fpeninsula of Crimea was hit for a third
OL,15,Ftime this week.                        
OL,17,FA combined missile-and-drone strike on 
OL,18,FTuesday destroyed the central road     
OL,19,Fsection of the bridge, collapsing part 
OL,20,Fof it into the water and rendering it  
OL,21,Funusable for road traffic.             
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
