OL,3,APutin vows 'far more painful' response 
OL,4,Ato Ukraine's strikes on Crimean Bridge 
OL,6,FBut at a press conference after        
OL,7,Fhistoric talks with his Chinese and US 
OL,8,Fcounterparts in Shenzhen, Russian      
OL,9,Fpresident Putin said Moscow's response 
OL,10,Fwould be even more significant.        
